{
    "title": "All-in-one Calculator Launcher",
    "description": "Simplify everyday calculations with Calculator Launcher, an all-in-one launcher app for everyday math & more. Calculator Launcher revamps your home screen to give you instant access to a basic calculator, tip calculator, and a unit converter. Split bills with friends, convert units while cooking or calculate the cost of a home improvement project. Our free calculator app has all the practical tools you need. \r\n\r\nKey features:\r\n\u2713 Basic calculator\r\n\u2713 Tip calculator\r\n\u2713 Unit converter \r\n\u2713 One-swipe access to the calculator\r\n\u2713 Multiple access points to search on Yahoo\r\n\r\n\u2797 Simple calculator: Perform quick calculations with ease. Whether you're calculating expenses, balancing your budget, or helping your grandkids with math homework, this tool gives you precise results, quickly.  \r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcf1Device search: Quickly access your favorite apps. Easily perform a device search for applications via the app drawer and multiple search touchpoints within the app \r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcb2Tip calculator: Dining out with friends? Take the guesswork out of tipping at restaurants with our easy-to-use tip calculator. Customize tip percentages, split bills effortlessly, and show your appreciation for great service.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd04Unit converter: Switching between units is a breeze with our unit converter calculator. Easily convert common units of measurement, like length (eg. mile to kilometer), volume (eg. gallon to liter), temperature (eg. Fahrenheit to Celcius), and more. No more scratching your head over conversions \u2013 let our app handle the math for you.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\ude80 One-swipe access: With a single swipe from your home screen, you can quickly access Calculator Launcher\u2019s features. Say goodbye to a cluttered home screen; all your essential calculators are just a swipe away. \r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd0d Multi-touchpoint search with search results powered by Yahoo: Finding what you need has never been easier. Enjoy an enhanced search experience with access to Yahoo web search via multiple access points.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfe0 Home screen shortcut: Use this shortcut on your home screen for instant access to Calculator Launcher. Your essential tools are always within reach, making everyday calculations a breeze.\r\n\r\nCalculator Launcher makes daily math a breeze. Download now and easily handle everyday calculations from the free app.\r\n\r\nPlease write to us should you have any queries or comments about the app, including recommendations for new features. Also, please note that you can uninstall it at any time.\r\n\r\nYou give your consent to install Calculator Launcher from the Google Play\u2122 Store by clicking the button above. You also agree to this app's Terms and Conditions & Privacy Policy.\r\n\r\nGoogle Play is a trademark of Google LLC. Use of it here does not imply any affiliation with or endorsement by Google LLC.\r\n\r\nExplore our FAQ section to find helpful information: https://calculatorhome.app/about-us#faq \r\nFor questions or feedback, reach out to us through our contact form: https://calculatorhome.app/contact-us\r\n\r\nTerms of Service: https://calculatorhome.app/terms-of-service\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://calculatorhome.app/privacy-policy",
